      },
      {
        "y": 142.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 256.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Fill the gaps in these sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 529,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Alec has spent most of his life in London, but he is keen to get back to his when he"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 373.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "retires. His family came from Scotland, so he’ll move there."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 364.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 The business is firmly in Western Australia."
      },
      {
        "y": 195.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 447.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The idea took some time to root, but it’s very fashionable now."
      },
      {
        "y": 207.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 404.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 His grandfather sowed the of the business’s success."
      },
      {
        "y": 219.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 427.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 The US bookshop chain is opening a number of in the UK."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 341.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 It’s about time she down some roots."
      },
      {
        "y": 243.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 444.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 The idea for her novel from her interest in mountain climbing."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 469.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The West Side Drama College turns out a hundred actors every year."
      },
      {
        "y": 271.7,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "31.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 274.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 492.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Divide the verbs in the box into two groups: verbs associated with growth and health"
      },
      {
        "y": 286.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 316,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and verbs associated with decline and death."
      },
      {
        "y": 306.9,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 441.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "fade flourish germinate shrivel sprout wilt thrive wither"
      },
      {
        "y": 333.4,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "31.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 336,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 405.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Suggest three nouns that each of these adjectives could describe."
      },
      {
        "y": 352.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 162.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 budding"
      },
      {
        "y": 364.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 172.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 flourishing"
      },
      {
        "y": 376.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 167.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 withering"
      },
      {
        "y": 388.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 153.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 fading"
      },
      {
        "y": 400.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 186,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 deeply rooted"
      },
      {
        "y": 412.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 160,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 thriving"
      },
      {
        "y": 428.8,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "31.5"
      },
      {
        "y": 431.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 462.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite the sentences using plant metaphors instead of the underlined words."
      },
      {
        "y": 447.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 474,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 My hopes of getting a job are disappearing. Unemployment is at an all-time record."
      },
      {
        "y": 459.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 375.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 The firm is cutting the labour force in order to reduce costs."
      },
      {
        "y": 471.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 413.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 She got rid of her inhibitions at the party and danced with everyone!"
      },
      {
        "y": 483.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 536.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 He and his wife are now receiving the rewards of many years of hard work building up their business."
      },
      {
        "y": 495.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 531.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 The party is trying hard to get rid of the extremists and create for itself a more moderate political"
      },
      {
        "y": 507.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 403.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "image. They want to reflect the views of their ordinary supporters."
      },
      {
        "y": 519.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 392.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 Some people seem to grow and develop on difficult challenges."
      },
      {
        "y": 531.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 421.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 A blogger found out some alarming facts about government spending."
      },
      {
        "y": 543.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 536.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Well, if you won’t study for your exams, don’t be surprised if you suffer the negative consequences"
      },
      {
        "y": 555.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 192.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of your actions."
      },
      {
        "y": 567.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 516.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 After three years of recession, we are beginning to see the first signs of an economic recovery."
      },
      {
        "y": 588.4,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "31.6"
      },
      {
        "y": 591.2,
        "x0": 127.7,
        "x1": 208.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Over to you"
      },
      {
        "y": 615,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 132.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "•"
      },
      {
        "y": 617.2,
        "x0": 137.4,
        "x1": 450.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Do you have any responsibilities that you would prefer to shed at the moment?"
      },
      {
        "y": 631.3,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 132.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "•"
      },
      {
        "y": 633.4,
        "x0": 137.4,
        "x1": 460.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Can you think of a situation where you reaped the rewards of something you did?"
      },
      {
        "y": 647.5,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 132.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "•"
      },
      {
        "y": 649.7,
        "x0": 137.4,
        "x1": 320.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "What in your life is flourishing at the moment?"
      },
      {
        "y": 663.8,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 132.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "•"
      },
      {
        "y": 665.9,
        "x0": 137.4,
        "x1": 256.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Where are your family’s roots?"
      }
